##### Python

::: {#st-scs-rec .cell execution_count=35}
``` {.python .cell-code}
def scs_rec(a, b):
    def f(i, j):
        if i == 0:
            return b[:j]
        if j == 0:
            return a[:i]
        if a[i - 1] == b[j - 1]:
            return f(i - 1, j - 1) + a[i - 1]
        left, up = f(i - 1, j), f(i, j - 1)
        if len(left) <= len(up):
            return left + a[i - 1]
        return up + b[j - 1]
    return f(len(a), len(b))
```
