**8. [M]** [LC 1641 · Count Sorted Vowel Strings](https://leetcode.com/problems/count-sorted-vowel-strings/){difficulty="Medium"}. Non-decreasing strings of length $n$ over the five vowels. ($n = 1 \to 5$; $n = 2 \to 15$.)

::: {.callout-note collapse="true" title="Solution"}
$dp[i][v]$ appends a vowel at least $v$. The totals are the combinations $\binom{n + 4}{4}$.

::: {#9a5fe82e .cell execution_count=98}
``` {.python .cell-code}
def vowel_strings(n):
    dp = [1] * 5
    for _ in range(n - 1):
        for v in range(3, -1, -1):
            dp[v] += dp[v + 1]
    return sum(dp)

assert vowel_strings(1) == 5 and vowel_strings(2) == 15
```
